            "block_content": "In conjunction with the establishment of the plan design and premiums as described in Subsections D(2) and E(2), the Trustees will determine what amount of benefits are appropriate to be paid from the Trust during the forthcoming year for Eligible Participants taking into consideration the amount of funds available and the need for those funds to provide benefits in accordance with the Trust Agreement.",
